<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Le Smack Trackre v1.15</title>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.js"></script>
<style>
  /* ── light mode (default) ── */
  :root {
    --bg:      #f4f3ee;
    --bg2:     #ffffff;
    --bg3:     #eeede8;
    --bg4:     #e4e3dc;
    --border:  #d8d6ce;
    --border2: #c8c6be;
    --text:    #1a1a18;
    --text2:   #5a5a52;
    --text3:   #9a9a90;
    --accent:  #3a7d1e;
    --accent2: #2d6018;
    --accentbg:#e8f5e0;
    --red:     #c0392b;
    --amber:   #c47a0a;
    --blue:    #1a6fa8;
    --green:   #1a7a3a;
    --font: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
    --radius: 6px;
    --chart-line: #1a6fa8;
    --chart-fill: rgba(26,111,168,0.08);
    --chart-grid: #e8e6de;
    --chart-tick: #9a9a90;
    --chart-bar:  rgba(58,125,30,0.18);
    --chart-bar-border: #3a7d1e;
  }
  /* ── dark mode ── */
  html.dark {
    --bg:      #0a0a0a;
    --bg2:     #111111;
    --bg3:     #1a1a1a;
    --bg4:     #222222;
    --border:  #2a2a2a;
    --border2: #333333;
    --text:    #e8e8e0;
    --text2:   #888880;
    --text3:   #555550;
    --accent:  #c8f060;
    --accent2: #8ab830;
    --accentbg:#1a2a08;
    --red:     #ff4444;
    --amber:   #f0a030;
    --blue:    #4ab0e8;
    --green:   #60d080;
    --chart-line: #4ab0e8;
    --chart-fill: rgba(74,176,232,0.07);
    --chart-grid: #1e1e1e;
    --chart-tick: #555550;
    --chart-bar:  rgba(200,240,96,0.15);
    --chart-bar-border: #c8f060;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); font-size: 14px; min-height: 100vh; transition: background .2s, color .2s; }

  .shell { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px 60px; }

  /* ── header ── */
  .hdr { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 0 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .hdr-left {}
  .hdr-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--accent); }
  .hdr-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px; }
  .hdr-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .hdr-time { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); letter-spacing: .04em; text-align: right; line-height: 1.5; }
  .theme-toggle { background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 20px; width: 52px; height: 28px; cursor: pointer; position: relative; flex-shrink: 0; transition: background .2s; }
  .theme-toggle::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 3px; left: 3px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); transition: transform .2s, background .2s; }
  html.dark .theme-toggle::after { transform: translateX(24px); }
  .theme-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

  /* ── nav ── */
  .nav { display: flex; gap: 2px; margin-bottom: 20px; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 3px; }
  .nav-btn { flex: 1; font-family: var(--font); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 8px 4px; border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text2); border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .12s; }
  .nav-btn:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--bg4); }
  .nav-btn.active { background: var(--bg2); color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--border2); font-weight: 700; }

  /* ── panels ── */
  .panel { display: none; }
  .panel.active { display: block; }

  /* ── cards ── */
  .card { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .card-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }

  /* ── metrics ── */
  .metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .metric { background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 10px 12px; }
  .metric-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .metric-val { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
  .metric-val.over { color: var(--red); }
  .metric-val.under { color: var(--blue); }
  .metric-val.ok { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── sliders ── */
  .ctrl-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .ctrl-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); width: 130px; flex-shrink: 0; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .ctrl-val { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); width: 100px; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }
  input[type=range] { flex: 1; -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; height: 3px; background: var(--bg4); border-radius: 2px; outline: none; cursor: pointer; }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance: none; width: 16px; height: 16px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; }
  input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb { width: 16px; height: 16px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; border: none; }

  /* ── legend ── */
  .legend { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); }
  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }

  /* ── range pill bar ── */
  .range-bar { display: flex; gap: 3px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .range-pill { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent; color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; transition: all .1s; white-space: nowrap; }
  .range-pill:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .range-pill.active { background: var(--accentbg); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }

  /* ── history ── */
  .hist-controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .hist-search { flex: 1; min-width: 160px; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 7px 10px; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; outline: none; }
  .hist-search:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .hist-search::placeholder { color: var(--text3); }
  select { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 7px 10px; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; outline: none; cursor: pointer; }
  select:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .log-entry-form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto 1fr auto; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; align-items: center; }
  .log-entry-form input { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 7px 10px; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; outline: none; }
  .log-entry-form input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .log-entry-form input::placeholder { color: var(--text3); }
  .hist-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; max-height: 560px; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; }
  thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--bg3); padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2); font-weight: 500; }
  tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: background .08s; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
  tbody td { padding: 7px 10px; color: var(--text2); }
  tbody td.dose-cell { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  tbody td.time-cell { color: var(--text); font-size: 11px; }
  .del-btn { background: none; border: none; color: var(--text3); cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; padding: 2px 4px; font-family: var(--font); }
  .del-btn:hover { color: var(--red); }

  /* ── import ── */
  .drop-zone { border: 1px dashed var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px 16px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; position: relative; background: var(--bg2); transition: all .12s; }
  .drop-zone:hover, .drop-zone.drag { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--bg3); }
  .drop-zone input { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .dz-icon { font-size: 28px; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .dz-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); }
  .dz-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 4px; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .preview-img { width: 100%; max-height: 220px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 10px 0; display: none; }
  .status-bar { font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius); margin: 8px 0; display: none; border: 1px solid; }
  .status-bar.loading { background: var(--bg3); color: var(--blue); border-color: var(--border2); }
  .status-bar.error { background: var(--bg3); color: var(--red); border-color: var(--border2); }
  .status-bar.ok { background: var(--accentbg); color: var(--green); border-color: var(--border); }
  .row-badge { font-size: 10px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .badge-new { background: var(--accentbg); color: var(--green); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .badge-dup { background: var(--bg3); color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid var(--border2); }
  .badge-err { background: var(--bg3); color: var(--red); border: 1px solid var(--border2); }
  .edit-cell { background: transparent; border: none; font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); width: 100%; padding: 0; }
  .edit-cell:focus { outline: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 2px; padding: 1px 3px; background: var(--bg3); }

  /* ── support ── */
  .support-card { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .support-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .support-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .pay-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .pay-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .pay-method { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; padding-top: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; width: 70px; }
  .pay-detail { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); flex: 1; }
  .pay-link { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
  .pay-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; color: var(--accent); }
  .btc-addr { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.5; }
  .honor-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

  /* ── buttons ── */
  .btn { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .06em; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius); cursor: pointer; transition: all .1s; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: none; font-weight: 700; }
  html:not(.dark) .btn-primary { color: #fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent2); }
  .btn-primary:disabled { opacity: .35; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--text2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--text2); color: var(--text); }
  .btn-small { font-size: 10px; padding: 3px 8px; letter-spacing: .05em; }

  /* ── Time Machine ── */
  .tm-anchor { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; margin-top: 8px; }
  .tm-btn {
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .02em; font-size: 8px; text-transform: uppercase;
    width: 96px; height: 24px; padding: 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font); line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box; transition: all .1s;
  }
  .tm-btn:hover { background: var(--accent2); border-color: var(--accent2); }
  .tm-btn.tm-on {
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);
  }
  .tm-btn.tm-on:hover { background: var(--accent2); color: #fff; }
  .tm-box {
    display: none; position: absolute; top: 0; left: calc(100% + 10px);
    z-index: 60; width: 260px; padding: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg2); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
  }
  .tm-box.open { display: block; }
  .tm-box-title {
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em;
    color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left;
  }
  .tm-box-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; }
  .tm-slider-row { margin-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; }
  .tm-slider-head {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .tm-slider-val { font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); font-size: 13px; }
  .tm-slider-row input[type=range] { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--accent); margin: 0; }
  .tm-slider-scale {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 9px; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 2px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  }
  .tm-target {
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); text-align: center;
    margin: 6px 0 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border2);
  }
  .tm-target span { font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .tm-banner {
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
    font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .02em;
    padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 4px;
    text-align: center; max-width: 200px; line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .now-block.tm-projected {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }


  /* ── symptom score buttons ── */
  .score-btn { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 11px; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: var(--bg3); color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; transition: all .1s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .score-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .score-btn.active { font-weight: 700; color: #fff; border-color: transparent; }

  /* ── symptom dot on chart ── */
  .symp-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }

  /* ── clinician modal ── */
  .modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); z-index: 1000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
  .modal-box { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; max-width: 520px; width: 100%; font-family: var(--font); max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; }
  .modal-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .modal-body { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .modal-body p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .modal-check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 16px; cursor: pointer; }
  .modal-check input { accent-color: var(--accent); width: 14px; height: 14px; cursor: pointer; }

  /* ── clinician panel ── */
  .instance-box { background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 14px 16px; margin: 12px 0; text-align: center; }
  .instance-id { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: .12em; margin: 6px 0; word-break: break-all; }
  .instance-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ── chart containers ── */
  .chart-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 280px; margin-top: 4px; }
  /* PK box enlarged to 150% (240 -> 360) */
  .pk-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 360px; min-height: 360px; margin-top: 4px; }
  #pkChart { display: block; width: 100% !important; height: 360px !important; }

  /* ── pk modifier + date calculator ── */
  .pk-modrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pk-fixed { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); }
  .pk-fixed b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .switch { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
  .switch .track { width: 40px; height: 22px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--bg4); border: 1px solid var(--border2); position: relative; transition: background .15s, border-color .15s; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .switch .track::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--text3); transition: transform .15s, background .15s; }
  .switch input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0; }
  .switch input:checked + .track { background: var(--accentbg); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .switch input:checked + .track::after { transform: translateX(18px); background: var(--accent); }
  .switch .sw-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .pk-daterow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 4px 0 12px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); }
  .pk-daterow input[type=date] { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 5px 8px; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; outline: none; }
  .pk-daterow input[type=date]:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .pk-daterow .daycount { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .pk-daterow button { font-family: var(--font); }

  /* ── mobile responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    html, body { font-size: 13px; }
    .shell { padding: 0 12px 60px; }
    .hdr { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 0 14px; }
    .hdr-title { font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .hdr-right { gap: 10px; }
    .nav { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .nav-btn { flex: 1 1 30%; font-size: 10px; padding: 7px 3px; }
    .ctrl-row { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .ctrl-label { width: auto; flex: 1 1 100%; }
    input[type=range] { flex: 1 1 60%; }
    .ctrl-val { width: auto; flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .pk-wrap { height: 300px; min-height: 300px; }
    #pkChart { height: 300px !important; }
    .chart-wrap { height: 240px; }
    .log-entry-form { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .hist-controls { gap: 6px; }
    .metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .now-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .pay-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
    .pay-method { width: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hdr-title { font-size: 16px; }
    .nav-btn { flex: 1 1 45%; }
    .metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .log-entry-form { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .now-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pk-wrap { height: 260px; min-height: 260px; }
    #pkChart { height: 260px !important; }
  }

  /* ── scrollbar ── */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; height: 5px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border2); border-radius: 3px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--text3); }

  /* ── cut guide ── */
  .film-diagram-wrap { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .film-diagram-title { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .film-svg-container { display: inline-block; }

  /* ── language selector ── */
  .lang-wrap { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .lang-btn { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: var(--bg3); color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; transition: all .1s; white-space: nowrap; }
  .lang-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .lang-btn.active { background: var(--accentbg); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .lang-menu { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0; z-index: 1200; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 6px; max-height: 60vh; overflow-y: auto; width: 200px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18); display: none; }
  .lang-menu.open { display: block; }
  .lang-opt { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; padding: 7px 10px; border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text); cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; }
  .lang-opt:hover { background: var(--bg3); color: var(--accent); }
  .lang-opt.active { background: var(--accentbg); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .lang-opt small { color: var(--text3); font-size: 10px; }
  html[dir="rtl"] .lang-menu { right: auto; left: 0; }
  html[dir="rtl"] .lang-opt { text-align: right; }

  /* ── dashboard now-status block ── */
  .now-block { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .now-cell .now-cap { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .now-cell .now-big { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.1; }
  .now-cell .now-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .now-cell .now-mid { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.2; }
  .now-stat-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; }
  .now-stat-pill { background: var(--accentbg); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 3px 10px; }
  .now-stat-pill .now-big { font-size: 22px; }

  /* ── footer disclaimer note (bottom of every panel) ── */
  .disc-note { margin-top: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .02em; line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); cursor: pointer; }
  .disc-note:hover { color: var(--text2); }

  /* ── final page / consent gate ── */
  .gate-box { background: var(--bg2); border: 2px solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .gate-box .gate-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .gate-box .gate-text { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .gate-check-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.5; }
  .gate-check-row input { margin-top: 2px; }
  .reset-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

  /* ── simulator unit toggle + interval controls ── */
  .unit-toggle { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; }
  .unit-toggle button { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .06em; padding: 5px 14px; border: none; background: var(--bg3); color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; transition: all .1s; }
  .unit-toggle button.active { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
  html.dark .unit-toggle button.active { color: #0a0a0a; }
  .interval-manual { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin: 8px 0 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .interval-manual input { width: 56px; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 5px 8px; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); font-size: 12px; outline: none; text-align: center; }
  .interval-manual input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .interval-manual span { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); }
  .preset-bar { display: flex; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }
  .preset-pill { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .05em; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent; color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; transition: all .1s; }
  .preset-pill:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .preset-pill.active { background: var(--accentbg); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }

  /* ── clinician monthly averages ── */
  .avg-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; }
  .avg-table th { text-align: left; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2); font-weight: 500; }
  .avg-table td { padding: 6px 10px; color: var(--text2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .avg-table td.avg-month { color: var(--text); }
  .avg-table td.avg-val { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-align: right; }
  .avg-table td.avg-n { text-align: right; color: var(--text3); font-size: 11px; }

  /* ── print ── */
  #printOnly { display: none; }  /* hidden on screen */
  @media print {
    body > * { display: none !important; }
    #printOnly { display: block !important; }
    #printOnly h2  { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 3px; color: #111; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
    #printOnly p   { font-size: 9px;  color: #444; margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; line-height: 1.6; }
    #printOnly .pw { color: #8a4400; }
    @page { margin: 10mm; size: portrait; }
  }</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">

  <div class="hdr">
    <div class="hdr-left">
      <div class="hdr-title">LE SMACK TRACKRE</div>
      <div class="hdr-sub"><span data-i18n="app_sub">buprenorphine dose &amp; planner</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; v1.15</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hdr-right">
      <div class="hdr-time" id="clockDisplay"></div>
      <div class="lang-wrap">
        <button class="lang-btn" id="langEnBtn" onclick="setLang('en')">English</button>
        <button class="lang-btn" id="langOtherBtn" onclick="toggleLangMenu()" data-i18n="lang_label">LANGUAGE</button>
        <div class="lang-menu" id="langMenu"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px">
        <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="toggle light/dark"></button>
        <span class="theme-label" id="themeLabel">light</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="nav">
    <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="showPanel('history',this)" data-i18n="nav_dashboard">dashboard</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showPanel('simulator',this)" data-i18n="nav_simulator">simulator</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showPanel('cutter',this)" data-i18n="nav_cutguide">cut guide</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showPanel('import',this)" data-i18n="nav_photo">photo import</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showPanel('support',this)" data-i18n="nav_license">purchase license</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" id="clinicianNavBtn" onclick="openClinician()" data-i18n="nav_clinician">clinician</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" id="finalNavBtn" onclick="showPanel('final',this)">disclaimers</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════ DASHBOARD ═══════════════ -->
  <div id="panel-history" class="panel active">

    <div class="now-block" id="nowBlock">
      <div class="now-cell">
        <div class="now-cap">est. receptor occupancy</div>
        <div class="now-stat-row">
          <div class="now-stat-pill"><div class="now-big" id="nowLevel">—</div></div>
          <div class="now-stat-pill"><div class="now-big" id="nowLevelEquiv">—</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="now-sub" id="nowLevelSub">&nbsp;</div>
        <div class="now-sub" id="nowRate" style="font-weight:700;margin-top:2px">&nbsp;</div>
        <div class="now-sub" id="nowJump" style="margin-top:2px">&nbsp;</div>
      </div>
      <div class="now-cell">
        <div class="now-cap" data-i18n="now_last_dose">last dose</div>
        <div class="now-mid" id="nowLastDose">—</div>
        <div class="now-sub" id="nowLastDoseTime">&nbsp;</div>
      </div>
      <div class="now-cell">
        <div class="now-cap" data-i18n="now_datetime">date &amp; time now</div>
        <div class="now-mid" id="nowDate">—</div>
        <div class="now-sub" id="nowTime">&nbsp;</div>
        <div class="tm-anchor">
          <button id="tmBtn" class="tm-btn" onclick="tmButtonClick()">Time Machine</button>
          <div id="tmBanner" class="tm-banner" style="display:none"></div>
          <div id="tmBox" class="tm-box">
            <div class="tm-box-title">move the clock forward</div>
            <div class="tm-box-note">Project how your on-board level, mg/mcg equivalents and receptor occupancy decay into the future. No doses are logged — a forward simulation from your existing dose log.</div>
            <div class="tm-slider-row">
              <div class="tm-slider-head"><span>days forward</span><span id="tmDaysVal" class="tm-slider-val">0 days</span></div>
              <input type="range" id="tmDays" min="0" max="14" step="1" value="0" oninput="tmSyncLabels();tmApplyFromSliders()">
              <div class="tm-slider-scale"><span>0</span><span>14 days</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-slider-row">
              <div class="tm-slider-head"><span>hours forward</span><span id="tmHoursVal" class="tm-slider-val">0 hrs</span></div>
              <input type="range" id="tmHours" min="0" max="36" step="1" value="0" oninput="tmSyncLabels();tmApplyFromSliders()">
              <div class="tm-slider-scale"><span>0</span><span>36 hrs</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-target">projected clock: <span id="tmTargetLabel">—</span></div>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" onclick="tmReturnToPresent()">return to the present</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-label" data-i18n="log_a_dose">log a dose</div>
      <div class="log-entry-form">
        <input type="datetime-local" id="logTime">
        <input type="number" id="logDose" placeholder="dose (mcg)" min="1" max="9999" step="1">
        <div class="unit-toggle" id="logUnitToggle" title="units for the dose you're logging — also sets the display unit for the whole app">
          <button id="logUnitMcg" class="active" onclick="setUnit('mcg')">mcg</button>
          <button id="logUnitMg" onclick="setUnit('mg')">mg</button>
        </div>
        <input type="text" id="logNotes" placeholder="notes (optional)">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="logDose()">+ log</button>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:4px">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" id="sympToggleBtn" onclick="toggleSympPanel()" style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.06em">+ add cravings / effect</button>
      </div>
      <div id="sympPanel" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px">cravings <span id="cravVal" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:13px">5</span></div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:6px">1 = none &nbsp;·&nbsp; 10 = severe</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap" id="cravBtns"></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px">dose effect <span id="effectVal" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:13px">5</span></div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:6px">1 = too little &nbsp;·&nbsp; 10 = too much</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap" id="effectBtns"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px">
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-bottom:0">receptor occupancy over time</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pk-modrow">
        <div class="pk-fixed">
          <span>half-life <b>36 hr</b></span>
          <span>time to peak <b>2 hr</b></span>
        </div>
        <label class="switch" title="Show the absorption-variability band (±1 SD)">
          <input type="checkbox" id="pkModToggle" onchange="onPkModToggle()">
          <span class="track"></span>
          <span class="sw-label">Modifier — ±1 SD absorption band</span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="pk-daterow">
        <span>custom range</span>
        <input type="date" id="pkDateStart" onchange="onPkDateRange()">
        <span>to</span>
        <input type="date" id="pkDateEnd" onchange="onPkDateRange()">
        <span class="daycount" id="pkDateCount"></span>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" onclick="clearPkDateRange()">clear</button>
      </div>

      <div class="range-bar" id="pkRangeBar"></div>
      <div class="pk-wrap">
        <canvas id="pkChart" role="img" aria-label="Estimated mu-opioid receptor occupancy over time">Estimated receptor occupancy over time.</canvas>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);text-align:center;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:.04em" id="pkFooter">est. μ-opioid receptor occupancy · PET-calibrated Emax model (t½=36hr, Tmax=2hr)</div>
      <div id="pkReduction" style="display:none;margin-top:10px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--card2,rgba(127,127,127,.08));border:1px solid var(--border,rgba(127,127,127,.2));font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text2)"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-label" data-i18n="dose_history">dose history</div>
      <div class="hist-controls">
        <input class="hist-search" type="text" id="histSearch" placeholder="search notes..." oninput="renderHistory()">
        <select id="histDays" onchange="renderHistory()">
          <option value="7">last 7 days</option>
          <option value="14">last 14 days</option>
          <option value="30">last 30 days</option>
          <option value="0" selected>all time</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" onclick="exportData()">export json</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" onclick="importJSON()">import json</button>
        <input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".json" style="display:none" onchange="handleImportFile(event)">
      </div>
      <div class="hist-table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr>
            <th>date / time</th><th>dose</th><th>crav</th><th>effect</th><th>notes</th><th></th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody id="histBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:8px" id="histCount"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="disc-note" onclick="showPanel('final',document.getElementById('finalNavBtn'))">Please read disclaimers on final page before using and acknowledge that your decisions are your own to be made with a licensed physician.</div>

  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════ SIMULATOR ═══════════════ -->
  <div id="panel-simulator" class="panel">

    <div class="card">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px">
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-bottom:0" data-i18n="sim_new_schedule">new schedule</div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
          <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase" data-i18n="sim_units">units</span>
          <div class="unit-toggle" id="unitToggle">
            <button id="unitMcg" class="active" onclick="setSimUnit('mcg')">mcg</button>
            <button id="unitMg" onclick="setSimUnit('mg')">mg</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ctrl-row">
        <span class="ctrl-label"><span data-i18n="sim_dose">dose</span> (<span class="unit-lbl">mcg</span>)</span>
        <input type="range" id="dose" min="75" max="24000" step="25" value="750" oninput="redrawSim()">
        <span class="ctrl-val" id="dose-out">750 mcg</span>
      </div>

      <div class="ctrl-row" style="margin-bottom:4px">
        <span class="ctrl-label" data-i18n="sim_interval">interval</span>
        <input type="range" id="interval" min="4" max="48" step="0.25" value="24" oninput="onIntervalSlider()">
        <span class="ctrl-val" id="interval-out">24h 0m</span>
      </div>
      <div class="interval-manual">
        <span data-i18n="sim_set_exact">set exact:</span>
        <input type="number" id="intervalH" min="0" max="48" step="1" value="24" inputmode="numeric" oninput="onIntervalManual()" onblur="normalizeIntervalManual()">
        <span>h</span>
        <input type="number" id="intervalM" min="0" max="59" step="1" value="0" inputmode="numeric" oninput="onIntervalManual()" onblur="normalizeIntervalManual()">
        <span>m</span>
      </div>
      <div class="preset-bar" id="presetBar">
        <button class="preset-pill" data-tau="48" onclick="setPreset(48,this)" title="every other day">QOD · 48h</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-tau="24" onclick="setPreset(24,this)" title="once daily">QD · 24h</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-tau="12" onclick="setPreset(12,this)" title="twice daily">BID · 12h</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-tau="8" onclick="setPreset(8,this)" title="three times daily">TID · 8h</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-tau="6" onclick="setPreset(6,this)" title="four times daily">QID · 6h</button>
      </div>

      <div class="ctrl-row" style="margin-bottom:0;margin-top:14px">
        <span class="ctrl-label"><span data-i18n="sim_ceiling">ceiling</span> (<span class="unit-lbl">mcg</span>)</span>
        <input type="range" id="ceiling" min="75" max="30000" step="25" value="2700" oninput="redrawSim()">
        <span class="ctrl-val" id="ceiling-out">2,700 mcg</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-label" data-i18n="sim_prior_ss">prior steady state</div>
      <div class="ctrl-row" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <span class="ctrl-label"><span data-i18n="sim_starting_peak">starting peak</span> (<span class="unit-lbl">mcg</span>)</span>
        <input type="range" id="startPeak" min="75" max="30000" step="25" value="2700" oninput="redrawSim()">
        <span class="ctrl-val" id="startPeak-out">2,700 mcg</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="metrics">
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">ss peak occupancy</div><div class="metric-val" id="ss-peak-occ">—</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">ss trough occupancy</div><div class="metric-val" id="ss-trough-occ">—</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-i18n="ss_peak">ss peak (equiv)</div><div class="metric-val" id="ss-peak">—</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-i18n="ss_trough">ss trough (equiv)</div><div class="metric-val" id="ss-trough">—</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-i18n="days_to_ss">days to ss</div><div class="metric-val" id="ss-days">—</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-i18n="vs_ceiling">vs ceiling</div><div class="metric-val" id="vs-ceiling">—</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend">
      <div class="legend-item"><div style="width:12px;height:3px;background:var(--chart-line);border-radius:2px"></div><span>blood level</span></div>
      <div class="legend-item"><div style="width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--red)"></div><span>ceiling</span></div>
      <div class="legend-item"><div style="width:18px;height:0;border-top:2px dashed var(--text3)"></div><span>prior peak</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-wrap">
      <canvas id="simChart" role="img" aria-label="Buprenorphine blood level simulation over 10 days">Blood level projection.</canvas>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);text-align:center;margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:.06em">days from first dose on new schedule</div>

    <div style="margin-top:18px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 18px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.85">
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px">how to use this simulator</div>

      <p style="margin-bottom:10px"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700">Dose</span> is the amount you take each time. <span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700">Interval</span> is how many hours between doses. Together they determine how much buprenorphine accumulates in your system and where it stabilizes — the <em>steady state</em> the chart converges to after roughly 5 half-lives (~8 days at default settings).</p>

      <p style="margin-bottom:10px"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700">Ceiling</span> is the upper limit you're trying to stay below — set it to your current stable peak if you're tapering, or to a clinical threshold if you have one. <span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700">Prior steady state</span> is where you're coming from. The chart shows what happens to your blood level when you switch from the old schedule to the new one.</p>

      <p style="margin-bottom:10px"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700">To plan a reduction:</span> lower the dose or lengthen the interval, watch the SS Peak metric, and check that the new peak falls where you want it. Small reductions in dose have a roughly linear effect on SS level. Lengthening the interval has a larger effect at short intervals and flattens out as intervals approach the half-life.</p>

      <p style="margin-bottom:10px"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700">Note on peaks and troughs:</span> buprenorphine's half-life is long (~36hr), so the level stays high between doses. At 24hr dosing with a 36hr half-life the trough sits around 63% of the peak; as you shorten the interval, peak and trough converge. The steady-state peak follows the accumulation ratio: 1 ÷ (1 − e<sup>−ke·τ</sup>) × dose — so 750 mcg once daily settles at about 2,070 mcg peak. Blood level is modeled so that each dose's peak contribution equals the dose amount exactly — 1,600 mcg + 250 mcg dose will peak at 1,850 mcg as those contributions accumulate. This is why splitting a dose feels smoother than one large dose even at the same daily total.</p>

      <p style="margin-bottom:0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text3);font-size:11px">This graph is a pharmacokinetic estimate based on a one-compartment oral model with population-average parameters. Individual response varies. What actually matters is whether your dose silences cravings and keeps withdrawal at bay — that's between you and your clinician, and no model replaces that feedback loop.</p>
    </div>

